  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Main path (bold arrows)",
      "items": [
        "Participants -> v4.9 program -> batches -> intake + QC -> one-command pipeline",
        "Step 3: hierarchical Laplace-EM fit -> LOO health gate -> citable thesis drafts",
        "Simulation line (Stages 2-5) fixes D4 before collection; Stage 9 plans the next round",
        "Collection in progress: 20 collected, 17 usable (4/5/4/4), cap 55"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Gates and criteria",
      "items": [
        "intake.py: technical / structure / consistency; duplicate batches are flagged as shadowed",
        "qc_group.py G1-G9 per P group; G8 = the P value must match the group design",
        "S6-1 ... S6-6 thresholds anchored on 87 historical participants (D85)",
        "LOO gate: n_flipped = 0, trial-level matrix, p_loo in [0, n_obs], k <= 0.7, n_draws >= 10; any BAD => exit 1",
        "Synthetic data (synth_truth.json) may enter Methods but never the Results chapter"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Equations (schematics: figures/speddm_wf_f01 ... f07)",
      "items": [
        "F1  d(t) = d_stim (t <= T); rho*d_stim (t > T), rho in [0, 3]; rho = 1 => M-T3",
        "F2  log Z = g(x*) + (K/2)ln2pi - 0.5 ln| -H |;  sigma^2 = mean[(x* - mu)^2 + Cov]",
        "F3  ELPD = sum log( mean_s w_s p(y_i | theta_s) );  cite only if p_loo and k hat pass",
        "F4  PPC: at least 10 of 12 statistics inside the 95% band",
        "F5  SE = sqrt(diag(I^-1));  n = (SD / SE_target)^2",
        "F6  J = A - 0.5B + C;  EI(x) = (mu* - mu)Phi(z) + sigma phi(z)",
        "F7  D4: 3 blocks x 4 T x 4 classes x 12 = 576 trials per person"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "External dependencies and environment",
      "items": [
        "MATLAB R2023b + Psychtoolbox 3.0.19 on the experiment machine (program v4.9)",
        "Python 3.13.9 + numpy 2.3.5 / scipy 1.16.3 / pandas 2.3.3 / matplotlib 3.10.6 / sklearn 1.7.2",
        "Zero-dependency route: Laplace approximation + own PSIS-LOO (no PPL in the pipeline)",
        "Optional HSSM env (pymc 5.28.5 + arviz 0.23.4 + hssm 0.3.0): probe only, pm.sample unavailable",
        "Real data: current batches + 87 historical + SPE-DB subset (25 datasets / 2,488 people)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Scope and known limits",
      "items": [
        "All inference is MLE + Laplace approximation: never call it a Bayesian posterior",
        "Participant-level PSIS-LOO is structurally unestimable; compare models at trial level (D73)",
        "Deadline convention (D48): v4.1 deadline = onset + W; historical line onset + T + W; convert, never mix",
        "Stage 9 does not change this round's collection; it reports the next-round prescription (D4 ranks 4th)",
        "Current state: 20 collected / 17 usable, cap 55, due 2026-02-21"
      ]
    }
